== Trivia ==
* Mama Gurdy appears to be the final stage of the "Gurdy" boss line, with the first stage as {{e|Gurglings}}, second as {{e|Gurdy Jr.}}, and third as {{e|Gurdy}}.
* Mama Gurdy is the only boss with boss art that doesn't directly display them, showing only a hand.
** She is also one of the only bosses not appearing as a degraded boss.
* {{e|Mother}}, the final boss of {{s|Corpse}}, appears to be a postmortem version of Mama Gurdy.

